OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 25 MAY
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,6,     GAnniversary Festival, two of
OL,7,     Gtoday's acclaimed quartets, the
OL,8,     GModigliani and the Leonkoro, come
OL,9,     Gtogether for a live performance
OL,10,     Gof Mendelssohn's Octet.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Miles Davis
OL,12,     F100
OL,13,     GKate Molleson explores the life
OL,14,     Gand work of a cultural icon:
OL,15,     Gtrumpeter, composer and
OL,16,     Gbandleader Miles Davis.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GLumas Winds perform live in the
OL,19,     Gstudio and opera writer and
OL,20,     Gbroadcaster Sarah Lenton talks
OL,21,     GKatie Derham through this
OL,22,     Gsummer's opera highlights.
