OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 25 MAY
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time our with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,7,     Gfavourites by composers such as
OL,8,     GBorodin, Rachmaninov and Rameau.
OL,9,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,11,     GAnniversary Festival, Ian Skelly
OL,12,     Gcomperes a special programme
OL,13,     Greplicating elements from
OL,14,     GWigmore's inaugural concert on
OL,15,     G31st May 1901.
OL,16,G2145FThe Essay: Miles Davis 100 -
OL,17,     FMiles Beyond
OL,18,     GJournalist Kevin Le Gendre
OL,19,     Ginvestigates how Miles Davis
OL,20,     Gnavigated racial politics and
OL,21,     Gperceptions of blackness, in his
OL,22,     Glife and music.
